ts, bluntly trying to cut the enemies or using their own bodies as a ram.</span></p></body>)/Rect[179.839 656.27 510.823 714.28]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj133 0 obj<</BS 148 0 R/Contents(Martial Arts Reminiscence - Unlike their memories, their cognition severely deteriorated over time, leaving little space for movements derived from their martial arts knowledge to be applied, like simple Combos, simple offensive moves and taking objects f\rom the environment to attack.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920223927-03'00')/NM(844ec8dc96c74e098e212ff672c9ebf7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Martial Arts Reminiscence - Unlike their memories, their cognition severely deteriorated over time, leaving little space for movements derived from th\eir martial arts knowledge to be applied, like simple Combos, simple offensive moves and taking objects from the environment to attack.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.166 568.744 512.459 626.754]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj134 0 obj<</BS 147 0 R/Contents(Blood Strikes - To compensate, the suffering they feel is capable of boost their blood in an uncommon manner, allowing for their living blood based moves to be done in a strangely better way, be it by hitting, \(Damage x1.5\), making the blood balls \(Dam\age x1.5\) or trying to drown the enemy in excessive amounts of blood.)/CreationDate(D:00000000000000Z)/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920224156-03'