ation - The most convenient part of this "curse", for the abominations, end up being one of their strengths, for the excessive accumulated blood, which is now cursed, along with their body distortions, allowed them to have a considerab\ly higher elasticity of their bodies, and the constant thirst for blood helped them keep the cycle constant by allowing them to steal any kind of blood for sustaining themselves.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 9 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 9.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920224557-03'00')/NM(2383cc0cbc544ff083fa42e90841cde2)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Cellular Universalization - The most convenient part of this &quot;curse&quot;, for the abominations, end up being one of their strengths, for the excessive accumulated blood, which is now cursed, a\long with their body distortions, allowed them to have a considerably higher elasticity of their bodies, and the constant thirst for blood helped them keep the cycle constant by allowing them to steal any kind of blood for sustaining themselves.</p></body\>)/Rect[177.875 297.522 516.059 360.532]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj137 0 obj<</BS 144 0 R/Contents(Body Resistance - Their distorted bodies possess a higher resistance due to such elasticity, being able to better resist \(Res x1.5\), absorb more damage \(Bonus x1.5\) and being able to intimidate aggressors more effectively due to the disturbing factor \of their body horror.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920224831-03'00')/NM(b7fd72cf7709488ca17aad559ac010e3)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Body Resistance - Their distorted bodies possess a higher resistance due to such elasticity, being able to better resist \(Res x1.5\), absorb more damage \(Bonus x1.5\) and being able to intimidate\ aggressors more effectively due to the disturbing factor of their body horror.</p></body>)/Rect[178.909 210.665 521.35 268.675]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj138 0 obj<</BS 143 0 R/Contents(Tormented Eyes - On the outside, they may have been forgotten for days, months, maybe years... But in their minds, an eternity of oblivion has passed. And with that, they learned to recognize fear, hunt prey as a predator animal or even alert any nearby a\bominations.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920225033-03'00')/NM(4ad9b17ed327424288eb2d55c9c580e4)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Tormented Eyes - On the outside, they may have been forgotten for days, months, maybe years... But in their minds, an eternity of oblivion has passed. And with that, they learned to recognize fear,\ hunt prey as a predator animal or even alert any nearby abominations.</p></body>)/Rect[182.784 124.93 521.622 175.905]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj139 0 obj<</BS 142 0 R/Contents(Blood Manipulation - Such as their minds and bodies, their blood over time also became gradually corrupted, making the way they manipulate it more focused on stop and deter any possible threats by poisoning their own blood, synthesizing a toxin, which the\y can curiously use to regenerate, and spray that blood as a cursed cloud.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920232843-03'00')/NM(e5d6d6beb785412c93a0ea2c110921d7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Blood Manipulation - Such as their minds and bodies, their blood over time also became gradually corrupted, making the way they manipulate it more foc\used on stop and deter any possible threats by poisoning their own blood, synthesizing a toxin, which they can curiously use to regenerate, and spray that blood as a cursed cloud.</span></p></body>)/Rect[182.784 32.3515 520.313 90.3615]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj140 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(                                                                                                         Notes\r)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 17.1 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 17.1pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920213521-03'00')/NM(5f15e8eb9fc54a00959a0547e7205bd6)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:17.1pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p d